%% Posting a story, ending, poll or image: automatic safety check before it goes live.
sequenceDiagram
    participant K as Kids web app
    participant A as Kids API
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant T as Cloud Tasks
    participant S as Safety check
    K->>A: POST /api/stories {body}
    A->>D: insert with status = checking
    A->>T: queue a check job
    A-->>K: "sending…"
    T->>A: POST /internal/safety-check {content_type, id}
    A->>S: classify the text or image
    A->>D: status = published, or hidden with hidden_reason = safety_check
